v 3
d plumber: audit every stage of a Stata data pipeline
d Brian W. Mandikiana <bwmandikiana@gmail.com>, SESRI, Qatar University
d https://github.com/codeatcodecto/plumber
d
d Install the four packages separately (no shared files), or run install.do.
d
p plumber    Compare two stages of a data pipeline: metadata, cases, values
p plumbchain Audit a sequence of pipeline stages with plumber (needs plumber)
p plumbmeta  Variable-level metadata snapshot of a dataset (data dictionary)
p plumbview  Side-by-side listing of variable values across two stages
